### Test API Category Endpoints
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5024
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### 1. CREATE - Root Categories
### ============================================

### 1.1 Create Technology Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "Technology",
  "categoryDescription": "All about technology and innovations",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 1.2 Create Business Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "Business",
  "categoryDescription": "Business news and finance",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 1.3 Create Sports Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "Sports",
  "categoryDescription": "Sports news and updates",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

