### ============================================
### 3. GET - Query with Filters
### ============================================

### 3.1 Get All Active Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?IsActive=true&PageSize=20

###

### 3.2 Get All Categories with Fields Projection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?Fields=CategoryID,CategoryName&PageSize=50

###

### 3.3 Search by Term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?SearchTerm=technology

###

### 3.4 Get Children of Technology (ID=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?ParentCategoryID=1&SortBy=CategoryName

###

### 3.5 Get Root Categories Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?PageSize=100

###

### 3.6 Combine: Search + Filter + Fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?SearchTerm=AI&IsActive=true&Fields=CategoryID,CategoryName,ParentCategoryID

###

### 3.7 Sort Descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?SortBy=CategoryName&SortOrder=desc&PageSize=20

###

### 3.8 Get Inactive Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?IsActive=false

###

### 3.9 Pagination - Page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category?PageNumber=2&PageSize=5

###

### ============================================
### 4. GET by ID
### ============================================

### 4.1 Get Technology Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/1

###

### 4.2 Get AI Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/4

###

### 4.3 Get Non-existent Category (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/9999

###

### ============================================
### 5. UPDATE
### ============================================

### 5.1 Update Technology Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryID": 1,
  "categoryName": "Technology & Innovation",
  "categoryDescription": "All about technology, innovations, and digital transformation",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 5.2 Move AI to Different Parent
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/4
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryID": 4,
  "categoryName": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "categoryDescription": "AI and ML technologies",
  "parentCategoryID": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 5.3 Deactivate Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/6
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryID": 6,
  "categoryName": "Mobile Apps",
  "categoryDescription": "iOS and Android",
  "parentCategoryID": 1,
  "isActive": false
}

###

### ============================================
### 6. DELETE
### ============================================

### 6.1 Delete Category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/10

###

### 6.2 Delete Non-existent (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/9999

###

### ============================================
### 7. EDGE CASES
### ============================================

### 7.1 Create with Empty Name (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "",
  "categoryDescription": "Test",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 7.2 Create with Null Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "Minimal Category",
  "categoryDescription": null,
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 7.3 Update with ID Mismatch
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Category/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryID": 999,
  "categoryName": "Wrong ID",
  "categoryDescription": "Test",
  "parentCategoryID": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 7.4 Create with Invalid Parent ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryName": "Orphan",
  "categoryDescription": "Test",
  "parentCategoryID": 99999,
  "isActive": true
}

###
